# cheap_testvec.bin is the numpy-parity fixture for the c20_h32 predictor host test
# (test_sake.c's check_cheap_vectors): sugar_predictor/metabonet/export_cheap_fw.py generates it
# only from MetaboNet's held-out "monitor" subjects, never this wearer's own data (unlike
# testvec.bin and hypo_testvec.bin below, which are personal and stay out). Without it the C-vs-
# numpy check silently skips rather than fails, on every machine but the one that generated it.
!tools/minimed_sake_hosttest/cheap_testvec.bin
